1470602	<note c="&lt;P_f_Footnote&gt;Differently, &lt;SP_f_AO_3a_-LIT&gt;Ünal A. 1974b&lt;/SP_f_AO_3a_-LIT&gt;, 44 &lt;SP_f_AO_3a_AkkGRAM&gt;A-NA&lt;/SP_f_AO_3a_AkkGRAM&gt; &lt;SP_f_AO_3a_SumGRAM&gt;GIG&lt;/SP_f_AO_3a_SumGRAM&gt;&lt;SP_f_AO_3a_Hittite&gt;-i&lt;/SP_f_AO_3a_Hittite&gt; &lt;SP_f_AO_3a_Hittite&gt;“(gaben&lt;/SP_f_AO_3a_Hittite&gt; &lt;SP_f_AO_3a_Hittite&gt;sie)&lt;/SP_f_AO_3a_Hittite&gt; &lt;SP_f_AO_3a_Hittite&gt;der&lt;/SP_f_AO_3a_Hittite&gt; &lt;SP_f_AO_3a_Hittite&gt;Krankheit”,&lt;/SP_f_AO_3a_Hittite&gt; followed by &lt;SP_f_AO_3a_-LIT&gt;Beal R.H. 1999a&lt;/SP_f_AO_3a_-LIT&gt;, 45 “To ‘sickness’. The sign looks, however, more like &lt;SP_f_AO_3a_SumGRAM&gt;TUR&lt;/SP_f_AO_3a_SumGRAM&gt; (see also &lt;SP_f_AO_3a_-LIT&gt;Warbinek L. 2020a&lt;/SP_f_AO_3a_-LIT&gt;, 245). Furthermore, there is no other attestation for &lt;SP_f_AO_3a_SumGRAM&gt;GIG&lt;/SP_f_AO_3a_SumGRAM&gt; as a token in the KIN oracle. For &lt;SP_f_AO_3a_AkkGRAM&gt;A-NA&lt;/SP_f_AO_3a_AkkGRAM&gt; &lt;SP_f_AO_3a_SumGRAM&gt;GIG.TUR&lt;/SP_f_AO_3a_SumGRAM&gt; see, e.g., KUB 5.4+ obv. I 23′, obv. II 17, KUB 5.3+ obv. I 41 and KUB 50.40 obv. 3′. For &lt;SP_f_AO_3a_AkkGRAM&gt;A-NA&lt;/SP_f_AO_3a_AkkGRAM&gt; &lt;SP_f_AO_3a_SumGRAM&gt;GIG.GAL&lt;/SP_f_AO_3a_SumGRAM&gt; see, e.g. KUB 5.1+ obv. II 20, rev. III 38, rev. III 38, 69, 81. &lt;/P_f_Footnote&gt;"/>
